Geer modifications

Geer converts the BF16 source into affine 6-bit MLX weights with group size
64. It fuses individually stored routed experts, retains the native vision
tower in BF16, and omits native MTP tensors through MLX-VLM 0.6.3's sanitizer.
The converted model-*.safetensors files, model.safetensors.index.json, and
config.json reflect these changes. MLX-VLM rewrites tokenizer/processor
metadata where required by its conversion path. The source and build
manifests identify the exact original and output files and their hashes.
Geer replaces the source model card with its conversion card and adds
licenses, this attribution record, the recipe, and provenance manifests.

